{
  "title": "Success/Failure Split Section",
  "type": "section",
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "split-section",
      "settings": {
        "background_background": "classic",
        "background_color": "#f5f9fd",
        "padding": {
          "top": "96",
          "bottom": "96",
          "left": "24",
          "right": "24",
          "unit": "px"
        }
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "split-column",
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "_column_size": "100",
            "_inline_size": "100"
          },
          "elements": [
            {
              "id": "split-headline",
              "type": "heading",
              "settings": {
                "title": "What winning looks like. What losing looks like.",
                "header_size": "h2",
                "align": "center",
                "text_color": "#0b2a4a",
                "typography_typography": "custom",
                "typography_font_family": "Playfair Display",
                "typography_font_size": {
                  "size": "40",
                  "unit": "px"
                },
                "typography_font_weight": "600"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "split-inner",
              "type": "inner-section",
              "settings": {
                "structure": "50_50"
              },
              "elements": [
                {
                  "id": "split-success",
                  "type": "column",
                  "settings": {
                    "_column_size": "50",
                    "_inline_size": "50"
                  },
                  "elements": [
                    {
                      "id": "split-success-icon",
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "editor": "<p>\u2713</p>",
                        "text_color": "#4caf50",
                        "typography_typography": "custom",
                        "typography_font_size": {
                          "size": "48",
                          "unit": "px"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "split-success-label",
                      "type": "heading",
                      "settings": {
                        "title": "What Winning Looks Like",
                        "header_size": "h3",
                        "text_color": "#2e7d32",
                        "typography_typography": "custom",
                        "typography_font_family": "Playfair Display",
                        "typography_font_size": {
                          "size": "28",
                          "unit": "px"
                        },
                        "typography_font_weight": "600"
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "split-success-list",
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "editor": "<ul><li>You stop dreading the phone.</li><li>Your week fits around your life instead of the other way around.</li><li>Your income stops depending on your calendar.</li><li>You can answer 'what's next' with something you can't wait to start.</li><li>When you do hand the practice off, it happens on your terms and your timeline.</li></ul>",
                        "text_color": "#0b2a4a"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "split-failure",
                  "type": "column",
                  "settings": {
                    "_column_size": "50",
                    "_inline_size": "50"
                  },
                  "elements": [
                    {
                      "id": "split-failure-icon",
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "editor": "<p>\u2717</p>",
                        "text_color": "#e53935",
                        "typography_typography": "custom",
                        "typography_font_size": {
                          "size": "48",
                          "unit": "px"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "split-failure-label",
                      "type": "heading",
                      "settings": {
                        "title": "What Losing Looks Like",
                        "header_size": "h3",
                        "text_color": "#c62828",
                        "typography_typography": "custom",
                        "typography_font_family": "Playfair Display",
                        "typography_font_size": {
                          "size": "28",
                          "unit": "px"
                        },
                        "typography_font_weight": "600"
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "split-failure-list",
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "editor": "<ul><li>Keep white-knuckling toward a retirement date that keeps moving.</li><li>Let the practice keep eating evenings and weekends.</li><li>Sell in a hurry to whoever shows up with a check.</li><li>Keep hating it quietly while everyone keeps congratulating you.</li></ul>",
                        "text_color": "#0b2a4a"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}